<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS0.Px4" title='In 4.2 Reranking Performance ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ "E"^2Rank: Your Text Embedding can Also be an Effective and Efficient Listwise Reranker' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{E}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mtext>E</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{E}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Rank</span> achieves competitive rerank accuracy across other strong baselines.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS0.Px5" title='In 4.2 Reranking Performance ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ "E"^2Rank: Your Text Embedding can Also be an Effective and Efficient Listwise Reranker' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Efficiency Analysis.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS0.Px6" title='In 4.2 Reranking Performance ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ "E"^2Rank: Your Text Embedding can Also be an Effective and Efficient Listwise Reranker' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{E}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mtext>E</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{E}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Rank</span> demonstrates strong performance on the BRIGHT benchmark.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
