<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><math id="m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{E}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mtext>E</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{E}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Rank</span>: Your Text Embedding can Also be an Effective and Efficient Listwise Reranker</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
