<section id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Full results on MTEB</h4>

<div id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present the detailed results on MTEB (eng, v1) benchmark of our models in Table <a href="#A4.T14" title='Table 14 ‣ Full results on MTEB ‣ Appendix D Additional Experimental Results ‣ "E"^2Rank: Your Text Embedding can Also be an Effective and Efficient Listwise Reranker' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a>. We also evaluate the models on MTEB (eng, v2) benchmark, and the results are shown in Table <a href="#A4.T15" title='Table 15 ‣ Full results on MTEB ‣ Appendix D Additional Experimental Results ‣ "E"^2Rank: Your Text Embedding can Also be an Effective and Efficient Listwise Reranker' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>.</p>
</div>
