<section id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Full results for end-to-end retrieval</h4>

<div id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present the detailed results of Table <a href="#S4.T6" title='Table 6 ‣ 4.4 Unified and End-to-End Retrieval and Reranking ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ "E"^2Rank: Your Text Embedding can Also be an Effective and Efficient Listwise Reranker' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> in Table <a href="#A4.T16" title='Table 16 ‣ Full results for end-to-end retrieval ‣ Appendix D Additional Experimental Results ‣ "E"^2Rank: Your Text Embedding can Also be an Effective and Efficient Listwise Reranker' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a> and Table <a href="#A4.T17" title='Table 17 ‣ Full results for end-to-end retrieval ‣ Appendix D Additional Experimental Results ‣ "E"^2Rank: Your Text Embedding can Also be an Effective and Efficient Listwise Reranker' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a>.</p>
</div>
