<section id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px5" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Full results for the ablation studies of training</h4>

<div id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present the detailed results of Table <a href="#S4.T6" title='Table 6 ‣ 4.4 Unified and End-to-End Retrieval and Reranking ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ "E"^2Rank: Your Text Embedding can Also be an Effective and Efficient Listwise Reranker' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> on Table <a href="#A4.T18" title='Table 18 ‣ Full results for the ablation studies of training ‣ Appendix D Additional Experimental Results ‣ "E"^2Rank: Your Text Embedding can Also be an Effective and Efficient Listwise Reranker' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a>, Table <a href="#A4.T19" title='Table 19 ‣ Full results for the ablation studies of training ‣ Appendix D Additional Experimental Results ‣ "E"^2Rank: Your Text Embedding can Also be an Effective and Efficient Listwise Reranker' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">19</span></a>, and Table <a href="#A4.T20" title='Table 20 ‣ Full results for the ablation studies of training ‣ Appendix D Additional Experimental Results ‣ "E"^2Rank: Your Text Embedding can Also be an Effective and Efficient Listwise Reranker' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">20</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T18" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 18: </span>Full results of ablation study on BEIR.</figcaption>
<table id="A4.T18.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
